email_engine_offline_body:
Hi,

We have not heard from your Promptbook project since {lastSeenAt}.

Project: {label}
Address: {hostname}
Project ID: {engineId}

Check that its server is running and connected to the internet. Its status is on the project page:

{link}

We send this once per outage and let you know when the project is back online.

